                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The First Committee of the United Nations General Assembly met on the afternoon
                    of December 13 from 3 to 6:15 p. m., at which time it approved by a vote of 51
                    to 5, with 1 abstention, the 13-power resolution (A/C.1/641) introduced on the
                    preceding day (see editorial note, page 1524); for the record of the meeting,
                    see U.N. document A/C.1/SR.417. The resolution was then forwarded to the General
                    Assembly with an interim report from the First Committee recommending its
                    adoption (A/1717).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
